@*
    BeasiswaIn
    Copyright (c) 2026
    Modification, redistribution, and commercial use are prohibited.

    Reusable form drawer: Bootstrap 5 offcanvas di kanan.
    Header + footer (Batal / Simpan) tetap, bagian tengah scroll sendiri.
    Submit lewat fetch (422 = error validasi server), termasuk field angka berformat dan field list.

    Pakai:

    @{
        Func<object?, IHtmlContent> createBody = @<div>
            <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="text-danger small mb-2"></div>
            ... field form (asp-for, validasi, dst) ...
        </div>;
    }

    @await Html.PartialAsync("_FormDrawer", new FormDrawerViewModel
    {
        Id = "createInquiryDrawer",
        Title = "Tambah Inquiry",
        Handler = "Create",
        Width = "480px",
        OpenOnLoad = !ModelState.IsValid,
        Body = createBody
    })

    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Field list = CHIPS. JS + CSS sudah ada di drawer. Tidak ada tombol "Tambah":
    ketik lalu Enter, atau pilih dari dropdown.

    Yang DIKIRIM ke server selalu "value" chip:
      - chips bebas          : teks yang diketik            -> property List<string>
      - chips + data-options : id dari opsi yang dipilih    -> property List<string> (berisi id)
    Teks yang tampil di chip (label) tidak ikut terkirim.

    1) Chips bebas (tanpa daftar pilihan):

        <div data-list-field
             data-name="CreateRequest.Requirement"
             data-placeholder="Tulis persyaratan"
             data-values="@JsonSerializer.Serialize(Model.CreateRequest.Requirement)">
            <label asp-for="CreateRequest.Requirement" class="form-label required"></label>
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" data-list-items></div>
            <span asp-validation-for="CreateRequest.Requirement" class="text-danger small"></span>
        </div>

    2) Chips + autocomplete dari data PageModel (mis. Model.CategoryOptions), kirim ID:

        <div data-list-field
             data-name="CreateRequest.CategoryIds"
             data-placeholder="Ketik untuk mencari kategori"
             data-options="@JsonSerializer.Serialize(Model.CategoryOptions)"
             data-values="@JsonSerializer.Serialize(Model.CreateRequest.CategoryIds)">
            <label asp-for="CreateRequest.CategoryIds" class="form-label required"></label>
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" data-list-items></div>
            <span asp-validation-for="CreateRequest.CategoryIds" class="text-danger small"></span>
        </div>

        C#:  public List<string> CategoryIds { get; set; } = [];

    data-options boleh:
      - array string                   -> value = label = teks itu
      - array objek { Id, Name }       -> value = Id, label = Name
      - List<SelectListItem>           -> value = Value, label = Text
    (nama properti dibaca tanpa peduli huruf besar-kecil. Label: name/label/text/title, value: id/value.)

    data-values (nilai awal) berisi value-nya (id). Id yang tidak ada di data-options dilewati,
    kecuali data-list-allow-custom="true".

    Cara pakai:
      - Ketik: dropdown menampilkan opsi yang cocok (teks yang cocok di-bold), opsi yang sudah dipilih disembunyikan.
      - Panah atas/bawah = pindah pilihan, Enter / klik = pilih, Esc = tutup dropdown.
      - Tanpa data-options: Enter = jadi chip. Backspace di input kosong = hapus chip terakhir.
      - Paste teks multi-baris = satu chip per baris. Koma bukan pemisah.
      - Dengan data-options, hanya nilai dari daftar yang bisa dipilih
        (tambah data-list-allow-custom="true" kalau teks bebas juga boleh).

    Atribut: data-name (wajib, nama property model), data-placeholder, data-options, data-values,
    data-list-min (default 1, 0 = opsional), data-list-message (pesan kustom kalau kurang dari minimal),
    data-list-allow-custom ("true" = boleh teks di luar daftar),
    data-list-mode="rows" (opsional: tampilan lama berupa baris input + tombol hapus + tombol tambah, data-add-label dipakai di sini).
    Baris dari server (opsional) boleh dirender dengan atribut data-list-row, otomatis dijadikan chip.
    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Pemicu: <button data-bs-toggle="offcanvas" data-bs-target="#createInquiryDrawer">
    (atau lewat config toolbar di _DataTable).
    Catatan: isi Body harus satu elemen root (<div>...</div>).
*@

@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Html
@using PhotographyStudio.Web.Pages.Dashboard.Shared

@model FormDrawerViewModel

@{
    var labelId = $"{Model.Id}Label";
    var widthStyle = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Width) ? null : $"--bs-offcanvas-width: {Model.Width};";
}

<div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end"
     id="@Model.Id"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="@labelId"
     style="@widthStyle"
     data-bs-backdrop="@(Model.StaticBackdrop ? "static" : "true")">

    <form method="post"
          hx-boost="false"
          data-ajax-form
          asp-page="@Model.Page"
          asp-page-handler="@Model.Handler"
          enctype="@(Model.Multipart ? "multipart/form-data" : null)"
          class="d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 overflow-hidden">

        <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom">
            <h5 class="offcanvas-title fw-semibold" id="@labelId">@Model.Title</h5>
            <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas" aria-label="Tutup"></button>
        </div>

        <div class="offcanvas-body">
            @if (Model.Body is not null)
            {
                @Model.Body(null)
            }
        </div>

        <div class="border-top p-3 d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-light" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas">@Model.CancelText</button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary px-4">@Model.SubmitText</button>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>

@if (Model.OpenOnLoad)
{
    <script>
        (() => {
            const open = () => {
                const el = document.getElementById("@Model.Id");
                if (el && window.bootstrap) bootstrap.Offcanvas.getOrCreateInstance(el).show();
            };

            document.readyState === "loading"
                ? document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", open, { once: true })
                : open();
        })();
    </script>
}

@if (Context.Items["__FormDrawerScripts"] is null)
{
    Context.Items["__FormDrawerScripts"] = true;

    <style>
        [data-list-field] {
            position: relative;
        }

        /* ---- field list: chips ---- */
        .list-chip-box {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: .4rem;
            height: auto;
            min-height: calc(1.5em + .75rem + 2px);
            padding: .35rem .5rem;
            cursor: text;
        }

        .list-chip-box:focus-within {
            border-color: #86b7fe;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 .25rem rgba(13, 110, 253, .25);
        }

        .list-chip-box.is-invalid {
            border-color: var(--bs-form-invalid-border-color, #dc3545);
            background-image: none;
            padding-right: .5rem;
        }

        .list-chip-box.is-invalid:focus-within {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 .25rem rgba(220, 53, 69, .25);
        }

        .list-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: .25rem;
            max-width: 100%;
            padding: .2rem .3rem .2rem .6rem;
            border-radius: .4rem;
            background: var(--bs-secondary-bg, #e9ecef);
            color: var(--bs-body-color);
            font-size: .875rem;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .list-chip-non-actionable {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: .25rem;
            max-width: 100%;
            padding: .2rem .325rem .2rem .325rem;
            margin: 0.2rem 0.1rem;
            border-radius: .4rem;
            background: var(--bs-secondary-bg, #e9ecef);
            color: var(--bs-body-color);
            font-size: .875rem;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .list-chip.is-invalid {
            background: var(--bs-danger-bg-subtle, #f8d7da);
            color: var(--bs-danger-text-emphasis, #842029);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--bs-danger-border-subtle, #f1aeb5);
        }

        .list-chip-text {
            min-width: 0;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .list-chip-remove {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex: none;
            width: 1.25rem;
            height: 1.25rem;
            padding: 0;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: transparent;
            color: inherit;
            opacity: .6;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .list-chip-remove:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .1);
        }

        .list-chip-remove svg,
        .list-chip-remove i {
            width: .9rem;
            height: .9rem;
        }

        .list-chip-input {
            flex: 1 1 8rem;
            min-width: 8rem;
            border: 0;
            outline: 0;
            background: transparent;
            padding: .15rem 0;
            font: inherit;
            color: inherit;
        }

        /* ---- dropdown autocomplete ---- */
        .list-chip-dd {
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1060;
            max-height: 220px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: .25rem;
            background: var(--bs-body-bg, #fff);
            border: 1px solid var(--bs-border-color, #dee2e6);
            border-radius: .5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 .5rem 1rem rgba(0, 0, 0, .15);
        }

        .list-chip-dd-item {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: .4rem .6rem;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: .35rem;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--bs-body-color);
            font-size: .875rem;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .list-chip-dd-item.active,
        .list-chip-dd-item:hover {
            background: var(--bs-secondary-bg, #e9ecef);
        }

        .list-chip-dd-item mark {
            padding: 0;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--bs-primary, #0d6efd);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .list-chip-dd-empty {
            padding: .4rem .6rem;
            color: var(--bs-secondary-color, #6c757d);
            font-size: .875rem;
        }
    </style>

    <script src="~/js/form-drawer.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
